                                                "sense_id": "cf0c1e92-205a-3d05-9b15-e2eeacf300ce",
                                                "text": "Another Internet concern is cyberbullying. LGBT youth sometimes are the targets of harassment by persons (usually other students) who use the Internet..."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "816e05eb-6cfe-45b1-9a16-c97895801a0b",
                                                "sense_id": "cf0c1e92-205a-3d05-9b15-e2eeacf300ce",
                                                "text": "Around one-third of those being cyberbullied told no one about the bullying."
                                            }
